/S /P
/P 122 0 R
/E (The experiment covered primitive data types, state, local and global variables, pure and view functions, multiple inputs and outputs, function visibility \(public, private, internal, external\), modifiers and constructors for access control, and control flow using conditionals and loops. Data structures \(arrays, mappings, structs and enums\) were implemented, and the difference between storage, memory and calldata was understood through the DataLocations contract. Finally, Ether and wei units, gas and gas price, and sending Ether using call were applied by building a Charity contract that accepts donations and lets the owner withdraw them. )
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
